🚀 Todo List App
A beautiful, responsive Todo List built with HTML, CSS & JavaScript. Add, delete, mark complete tasks with localStorage persistence!

✨ Features
✅ Add Tasks (Click Add or Enter key)
✅ Mark Complete (Click task → beautiful circle animation)
✅ Delete Tasks (× button)
✅ Data Persists (localStorage - survives refresh)
✅ Smooth Animations & Hover Effects
✅ Fully Responsive
✅ Modern Gradient UI